  "classification": "CLOSED NORMAL RAW-OTP SOURCE CLASS: the front sensor KMD reads the front camera module's physical EEPROM into its +0x320/+0x328 cache. A zero InitParams option publishes that exact cache as SensorCalibrationData; DeviceMFT copies it into DataManager+0xc8/+0xd0 and uses it as EEPROMData raw input. A nonzero option intentionally drops the KMD cache, after which DeviceMFT takes its camera-local CreateAndReadEEPROMData/ReadEEPROMDevice fallback. Both routes therefore source raw OTP from the front camera module's physical EEPROM and converge before FormatLSCData. Rear camera0 raw-OTP pointer/buffer injection is excluded on the normal path.",
